# issue #82 (range half): the range-side sibling of chainpoison.ofn. Chain(t,u)
# ⊑ r, ObjectPropertyRange(r, owl:Nothing): the chain-materialised r-edge's
# target must be in owl:Nothing, so C must be unsatisfiable. NEITHER rustdl NOR
# Konclude reports this — the claim rests on hand-derivation alone, not on
# peer agreement. See docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-27-negative-certificates-
# phase1-design.md and issue #82.
provenance: derivation-only   # BOTH rustdl and Konclude miss this; see issue #82
unsatisfiable: C
